WEBVTT

00:00:08.320 --> 00:00:14.780
Humans pray to beings they cannot see
or whose existence they cannot prove.

00:00:14.780 --> 00:00:18.410
God, Buddha, or even mysterious
forces from outer space.

00:00:18.410 --> 00:00:22.500
If one's prayers are answered, they believe
in the existence of their guiding force.

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:25.670
If not, they doubt whether
their prayers were sufficient.

00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:30.920
Either way, they continue to believe.

00:00:33.930 --> 00:00:38.640
Please, let Arashiyama and I
become closer this summer.

00:00:39.180 --> 00:00:41.060
I don't mean "closer" in
an impure way, though.

00:00:41.060 --> 00:00:43.810
But if I had to say one way or the other,

00:00:43.810 --> 00:00:49.320
I wouldn't be against the idea,
I just wanna take it slow.

00:00:49.320 --> 00:00:53.650
Something like that.

00:00:53.650 --> 00:00:57.450
No wait, I don't mean like a
"just friends" type of thing-

00:00:57.450 --> 00:00:59.080
Of course I'm totally serious-

00:00:59.080 --> 00:01:03.200
I mean, I honestly value her feelings too-

00:01:03.200 --> 00:01:07.460
If I just meant that in a naughty
way, that'd make me a creep-

00:01:07.460 --> 00:01:11.130
Wait, that's not the
point I'm trying to make.

00:01:11.130 --> 00:01:13.210
Uhh, I kinda lost my train of thought,

00:01:13.210 --> 00:01:16.050
but since you're a god,
I'm sure you understand.

00:01:16.050 --> 00:01:17.680
Anyway, I beg of you!

00:01:24.430 --> 00:01:26.480
Whatever beings they may be,

00:01:27.520 --> 00:01:29.980
the hard part isn't granting the wish,
but first figuring out what the wish is.

00:03:00.660 --> 00:03:02.530
We are being watched.

00:03:02.910 --> 00:03:05.530
For the next 9 minutes and 16 seconds.

00:03:05.910 --> 00:03:11.290
Separate from the cage of your body and its
perception, and surpass the boundaries of common sense.

00:03:11.290 --> 00:03:14.920
For we shall now set foot
into a world of mystery.

00:03:14.920 --> 00:03:17.670
Guided towards a realm of
neither truth nor fiction.

00:03:18.920 --> 00:03:21.630
Welcome to the Maruko Shopping District.

00:03:24.350 --> 00:03:27.010
Can you see this, ladies and gentlemen?

00:03:27.010 --> 00:03:33.690
Last night, several perfectly circular
holes were discovered in this empty lot.

00:03:33.690 --> 00:03:37.730
An apartment complex was slated
for construction on this lot,

00:03:37.730 --> 00:03:44.450
but there appeared to be discord between the
developers and local residents opposed to the construction.

00:03:44.450 --> 00:03:50.660
We've also received reports that a young
woman's scream was heard during the night.

00:03:50.660 --> 00:03:56.340
Just who made these holes,
why, and how did they do it?

00:03:56.340 --> 00:03:58.670
This phenomenon just keeps
becoming more and more bizarre.

00:03:58.670 --> 00:04:00.590
That's all for now, reporting live on scene.

00:04:00.590 --> 00:04:04.010
That was Miss Suekane, reporting
from the scene of the crime.

00:04:04.010 --> 00:04:08.510
We have with us an expert on
digging, Professor Majima.

00:04:08.510 --> 00:04:10.810
Please share with us your expert opinion.

00:04:10.810 --> 00:04:15.310
Certainly. I've dug countless holes
of varying types over the years,

00:04:15.310 --> 00:04:22.320
but to dig holes of this size and in near-perfect
circles, one would require large, sophisticated machinery.

00:04:22.320 --> 00:04:23.820
Something wrong, Hotori?

00:04:23.820 --> 00:04:26.070
No, nothing's wrong.

00:04:26.070 --> 00:04:28.910
If you don't hurry up and eat,
you'll be late for school again.

00:04:34.420 --> 00:04:36.460
Finally! The day has come!

00:04:36.460 --> 00:04:37.880
Did you watch the news this morning?

00:04:40.340 --> 00:04:42.800
Hey, I'm asking you if you saw it or not!

00:04:42.800 --> 00:04:46.510
Senpai, you're very "orange" today.

00:04:46.510 --> 00:04:47.510
Orange?

00:04:47.510 --> 00:04:50.060
It means the opposite of "blue".

00:04:51.020 --> 00:04:54.140
In that case, you've been "blue" all day.

00:04:54.140 --> 00:04:55.020
You on your period?

00:04:55.020 --> 00:04:56.440
No, I'm not.

00:04:59.940 --> 00:05:04.570
You can tell I'm depressed, so how
about a little more consideration?

00:05:05.200 --> 00:05:07.410
That's not the time for this!

00:05:07.410 --> 00:05:10.030
You live near that lot with
the weird holes, don't you?

00:05:10.030 --> 00:05:12.580
Where is it? C'mon, take me there.

00:05:12.580 --> 00:05:13.250
Forget it.

00:05:13.250 --> 00:05:16.460
What's your deal? Don't you
normally love stuff like this?

00:05:17.670 --> 00:05:19.290
I know I do.

00:05:19.290 --> 00:05:21.380
I always knew something like
this would happen one day.

00:05:21.670 --> 00:05:24.670
Like waking up with horns coming
outta my head or something.

00:05:24.670 --> 00:05:27.340
And today, something finally did!

00:05:27.340 --> 00:05:31.970
That report convinced me that I
was meant to see that empty lot!

00:05:31.970 --> 00:05:34.890
C'mon, show me!

00:05:37.350 --> 00:05:40.690
Do you hate living a normal life THAT much?

00:05:40.690 --> 00:05:42.070
I do.

00:05:47.110 --> 00:05:48.070
Jerkface!

00:05:54.200 --> 00:05:59.960
I don’t know what crawled up your ass,
but you could at least tell me about it.

00:06:01.500 --> 00:06:02.750
If only to get it off your chest.

00:06:09.300 --> 00:06:10.510
We're friends, aren't we?

00:06:13.010 --> 00:06:14.770
Senpai!

00:06:14.770 --> 00:06:15.890
Hotori?

00:06:16.770 --> 00:06:18.730
I can't take you to the empty lot!

00:06:20.060 --> 00:06:23.520
'Cause I'm the one who made those holes!

00:06:23.520 --> 00:06:24.610
Whaaat!?

00:06:27.070 --> 00:06:31.280
You see, last night, I went to buy some
Koala Ice Cream from the convenience store.

00:06:31.280 --> 00:06:35.200
Oh yeah, they don't sell those
at the Green Mart by my place.

00:06:35.200 --> 00:06:36.450
What flavor did you get?

00:06:36.450 --> 00:06:37.120
Strawberry.

00:06:37.120 --> 00:06:39.420
You idiot! Vanilla's obviously the best!

00:06:39.420 --> 00:06:41.130
Whatever, just listen to me!

00:06:41.130 --> 00:06:44.090
So anyway, I started back towards my house.

00:06:44.090 --> 00:06:45.090
With that stupid doofus grin.

00:06:45.090 --> 00:06:46.510
Just shut up and listen!

00:06:46.510 --> 00:06:50.050
And that's when I came across
the mysterious device.

00:06:50.800 --> 00:06:53.180
Hmm? What the heck is this?

00:06:53.180 --> 00:06:54.720
A laser gun?

00:06:54.720 --> 00:06:57.770
Awful heavy for a kid's toy.

00:06:57.770 --> 00:07:00.100
There's no trigger or muzzle either.

00:07:00.100 --> 00:07:02.650
Maybe it's a model from some movie.

00:07:03.480 --> 00:07:04.400
Bang.

00:07:51.400 --> 00:07:53.280
Y-You want this?

00:07:53.280 --> 00:07:55.700
You're saying you want me
to give this back, right?

00:07:55.700 --> 00:07:56.530
That must be it.

00:07:56.530 --> 00:07:57.700
Can he understand me?

00:07:59.160 --> 00:08:03.710
Here, you can have it back! You
can even have my ice cream.

00:08:03.710 --> 00:08:08.130
It's the most delicious food
on the entire planet, yup.

00:08:08.130 --> 00:08:13.010
I'm not sure if you'd like it, but
please try some before it melt-

00:08:14.510 --> 00:08:16.510
Oh crap, there's another!

00:08:16.510 --> 00:08:19.260
Another one! A black one showed up!

00:08:34.610 --> 00:08:37.740
Umm, w-who s-should I give it t-to?

00:08:37.740 --> 00:08:40.290
Can one of you just take the ice cream?

00:08:40.290 --> 00:08:43.460
No dice, huh? Guess not. Nope.

00:08:46.960 --> 00:08:48.090
It's armed!?

00:08:57.680 --> 00:08:59.810
Oh no, I did it again.

00:09:27.620 --> 00:09:33.340
And so all that remained was me,
the holes, and my ice cream.

00:09:33.340 --> 00:09:35.840
Oh, so that's what happened, huh?

00:09:35.840 --> 00:09:39.930
You actually believe such a ridiculous story?

00:09:39.930 --> 00:09:43.220
Yeah. Normally, I'd just
kick you good and hard.

00:09:43.680 --> 00:09:47.900
Am I gonna be arrested
for making those holes?

00:09:54.320 --> 00:09:56.610
What is that? A present for me or something?

00:09:56.610 --> 00:09:57.530
Dream on.

00:09:57.530 --> 00:09:59.200
I found it yesterday.

00:09:59.490 --> 00:10:04.200
Looks like the same material as
that laser gun was made from.

00:10:05.830 --> 00:10:08.920
Relax, this thing isn't dangerous.

00:10:08.920 --> 00:10:11.090
Lemme see one of the chopsticks
you were eating with.

00:10:14.250 --> 00:10:15.840
You mean this?

00:10:15.840 --> 00:10:17.130
Check this out.

00:10:18.630 --> 00:10:21.470
What the heck are you doing!?
My mom's gonna kill me!

00:10:21.470 --> 00:10:24.140
Relax, it'll be fine.

00:10:24.140 --> 00:10:28.480
No it won't! Please don't give
me more stuff to agonize over!

00:10:28.940 --> 00:10:29.730
Watch this.

00:10:36.900 --> 00:10:38.400
No way! It's fixed!

00:10:38.400 --> 00:10:39.570
It's back to normal!

00:10:39.570 --> 00:10:43.280
This is the reason I
believe your crazy story.

00:10:48.540 --> 00:10:51.960
The very next day after I found
this, I saw that news story.

00:10:51.960 --> 00:10:55.170
That's why I figured something
exciting was about to happen.

00:10:55.170 --> 00:10:57.420
I've finally broken free from my boring life!

00:10:57.420 --> 00:11:01.680
And I'm at the center of
this bizarre phenomenon!

00:11:01.680 --> 00:11:05.760
Well, you're the one who actually
got to have all the fun.

00:11:05.760 --> 00:11:09.350
I'm basically just tagging along.

00:11:10.640 --> 00:11:13.440
Oh well, that's good enough for me.

00:11:18.440 --> 00:11:20.820
I'm just glad that I can be a part of it.

00:11:27.160 --> 00:11:29.540
Hey, the holes are being repaired!

00:11:31.080 --> 00:11:37.380
If, perhaps, Hotori placed a tiny headstone
in the Maruko district's empty lot,

00:11:37.380 --> 00:11:39.670
it would be in memory of the departed alien.

00:11:41.800 --> 00:11:43.800
Now everything's as good as new.

00:11:43.800 --> 00:11:45.800
Thank you, Kon-senpai!

00:11:45.800 --> 00:11:48.140
All's well that ends well...

00:12:09.240 --> 00:12:13.750
This incident actually took place
right in our very own backyard.

00:12:13.750 --> 00:12:18.630
Whether you choose to believe
it or not is entirely up to you.

00:12:27.390 --> 00:12:29.220
That your account leger?

00:12:29.220 --> 00:12:31.980
You sure aren't living the high life, are ya?

00:12:31.980 --> 00:12:35.150
You've never been able to
make it work, have you?

00:12:35.150 --> 00:12:37.900
Before the 100 yen shop, you
tried running a liquor store.

00:12:37.900 --> 00:12:39.610
And before that, you tried selling futons.

00:12:42.780 --> 00:12:44.110
COMBS ARE FOR PEOPLE WITH HAIR!

00:12:48.530 --> 00:12:51.540
Ignored again... figures.

00:13:04.420 --> 00:13:06.720
Oh, you can see me?

00:13:09.010 --> 00:13:10.510
I'll take that as a "yes".

00:13:11.470 --> 00:13:13.850
What happened to your tail, fella?

00:13:14.560 --> 00:13:19.820
I don’t know where or how you
lost it, but it must've been rough.

00:13:26.700 --> 00:13:30.160
Please, carry on my dream...

00:13:30.990 --> 00:13:34.200
A place where everyone can relax and co-

00:13:35.580 --> 00:13:36.830
Comoony.

00:13:37.620 --> 00:13:40.540
Comyunee.

00:13:42.130 --> 00:13:44.010
Yeah, that's it.

00:14:05.690 --> 00:14:07.030
Am I dead?

00:14:07.570 --> 00:14:09.240
I blew my last chance...

00:14:09.240 --> 00:14:13.040
I couldn't remember the word,
and never got to say it.

00:14:13.040 --> 00:14:17.660
I was a stubborn fool ‘till the very end.

00:14:17.660 --> 00:14:21.670
Well, I don't really have any regrets.

00:14:33.560 --> 00:14:35.390
They've come to pick me up, huh?

00:14:40.900 --> 00:14:41.650
Huh?

00:14:43.020 --> 00:14:44.400
Guess they weren't here for me.

00:14:51.620 --> 00:14:52.200
Ah-

00:15:08.170 --> 00:15:10.180
Hey, where's MY escort!?

00:15:12.050 --> 00:15:19.390
I don't know who caused that screw-up, but for
the past 10 years I've been wandering here, all alone.

00:15:19.390 --> 00:15:20.440
Pretty neat, huh?

00:15:20.810 --> 00:15:23.190
I guess we've both been through a lot.

00:15:24.860 --> 00:15:25.480
Found you!

00:15:25.480 --> 00:15:26.190
Coban!

00:15:26.190 --> 00:15:29.950
Why are you always running off on your own?

00:15:29.950 --> 00:15:31.360
You're fickleness incarnate.

00:15:32.320 --> 00:15:34.370
What are you staring at, anyway?

00:15:35.950 --> 00:15:38.870
See ya. You hang in there, okay?

00:15:38.870 --> 00:15:40.960
Are you following something?

00:15:41.580 --> 00:15:43.670
Hey, you're freakin' me out!

00:15:43.670 --> 00:15:45.960
Don't tell me you see a ghost or something!

00:15:45.960 --> 00:15:47.840
Well excuse me for being a ghost!

00:15:51.090 --> 00:15:54.590
Come to think of it, I do
often meet eyes with animals.

00:16:02.390 --> 00:16:05.770
But not once have people ever noticed me.

00:16:09.530 --> 00:16:12.820
Not even the priest notices me.

00:16:16.580 --> 00:16:18.490
C'mon, Josephine, run!

00:16:19.200 --> 00:16:21.200
She's hell-bent on just walking, huh?

00:16:21.200 --> 00:16:24.170
We're not gonna walk you if you're
not getting anything out of it.

00:16:24.170 --> 00:16:24.920
Hey there!

00:16:27.380 --> 00:16:29.500
Guess there's animals that are oblivious too.

00:16:31.550 --> 00:16:33.840
So? What about this girl, now?

00:16:33.840 --> 00:16:36.470
Oh, right. She's something else, I tell ya.

00:16:36.470 --> 00:16:38.760
How do I put it. It's almost like...

00:16:38.760 --> 00:16:39.760
Like what?

00:16:39.760 --> 00:16:41.060
A rock lobster!

00:16:41.060 --> 00:16:42.390
What kind of analogy is that!?

00:16:42.560 --> 00:16:44.520
Hey, nice timing.

00:16:45.690 --> 00:16:47.810
You gotta work on your vocabulary.

00:16:49.610 --> 00:16:51.860
Hey Takeru, you got the hots for her?

00:16:51.860 --> 00:16:55.410
I do not! You always have to bring that up!

00:17:02.410 --> 00:17:03.910
There we go...

00:17:10.380 --> 00:17:14.760
I thought of making deep-fried tofu today.

00:17:14.760 --> 00:17:20.260
But apparently, Hotori wolfed
it down sometime yesterday.

00:17:21.470 --> 00:17:24.020
She's quite the handful, that girl.

00:17:24.020 --> 00:17:26.390
No big deal. Old fashioned tofu is just fine.

00:17:26.390 --> 00:17:30.570
The men from the shopping
district were at it again, too.

00:17:30.570 --> 00:17:32.570
They just won't pay attention
when I tell 'em to shut up.

00:17:32.570 --> 00:17:34.490
Why can't they just argue
at their own stores?

00:17:34.490 --> 00:17:38.490
They can't help it. Men just never grow up.

00:17:38.490 --> 00:17:42.740
If you were still here, I bet you'd
be in there making a fuss too.

00:17:44.370 --> 00:17:47.920
Y'know, I think it's finally
starting to get livelier again.

00:17:48.500 --> 00:17:50.460
Just like when you were there.

00:17:50.460 --> 00:17:52.920
Hey, it's been ten years already.

00:17:52.920 --> 00:17:56.930
If you keep praying that hard,
I'm gonna have to move on.

00:18:01.140 --> 00:18:02.970
Well then, goodnight dear.

00:18:03.930 --> 00:18:07.690
Let's see... where'd I put it?

00:18:07.690 --> 00:18:12.270
This'll work for today, right? You
always loved bananas, didn't you?

00:18:14.030 --> 00:18:16.070
I'm pretty sure.

00:18:16.070 --> 00:18:16.900
I think so.

00:18:16.900 --> 00:18:20.280
Maybe you're not praying THAT hard...

00:18:20.280 --> 00:18:25.370
Guess you're at the age where
you start forgetting my habits.

00:18:26.120 --> 00:18:28.420
I didn't forget a damn thing.

00:18:28.420 --> 00:18:29.290
Ack!

00:18:31.250 --> 00:18:34.550
You've never even bothered
to show up in my dreams.

00:18:34.550 --> 00:18:36.010
Some husband you were.

00:18:36.010 --> 00:18:37.420
How about right now!?

00:18:37.420 --> 00:18:41.050
Oh well, you're probably just
goofing off on the other side.

00:18:41.430 --> 00:18:47.270
Yup, ever since I yelled
at heaven the day I died,

00:18:47.270 --> 00:18:49.440
I've just been doing whatever I please.

00:18:49.440 --> 00:18:53.270
Well the <i>communication's</i>
only one sided, though.

00:18:54.480 --> 00:18:56.440
Hey, cut the crap, man!

00:18:56.440 --> 00:18:58.780
Kobuhei's my disciple!

00:18:58.780 --> 00:19:01.030
You just don't get it, do you?

00:19:01.030 --> 00:19:03.370
I SAID he's MY disciple!

00:19:03.370 --> 00:19:06.240
Besides, I made up that nickname anyway!

00:19:06.240 --> 00:19:08.710
You're screwed no matter
who you go with, huh pal?

00:19:10.080 --> 00:19:12.830
I can't believe you were late again today.

00:19:12.830 --> 00:19:18.170
And you yawned during class even though you
came late. No wonder the teacher got mad.

00:19:18.170 --> 00:19:23.350
But I thought he'd let it slide
since the week just started.

00:19:23.350 --> 00:19:24.350
Not a chance.

00:19:24.350 --> 00:19:24.800
I know...

00:19:24.800 --> 00:19:25.810
Dream on.

00:19:25.810 --> 00:19:26.310
I know...

00:19:26.310 --> 00:19:27.270
The hell he would.

00:19:27.270 --> 00:19:28.430
Okay, I get it...

00:19:28.640 --> 00:19:30.890
You're seriously gonna be held back.

00:19:30.890 --> 00:19:32.520
Good evening!

00:19:33.100 --> 00:19:36.150
There's lots of folks to
chat with up here, huh?

00:19:38.110 --> 00:19:41.660
Hey now, you're gonna get it
from that blonde lass again.

00:19:55.040 --> 00:19:55.920
Toshiko-chan.

00:19:55.920 --> 00:19:56.420
Yes, ma'am?

00:19:56.710 --> 00:20:00.420
Would you please fix a cup of coffee
and leave it by the back booth?

00:20:03.890 --> 00:20:05.470
You mean this one?

00:20:05.470 --> 00:20:06.890
Yeah, thanks dear.

00:20:19.900 --> 00:20:20.740
Uki...

00:20:23.780 --> 00:20:26.320
You can see me?

00:20:44.380 --> 00:20:45.680
THAT WAS FOR YOU!?

00:20:46.550 --> 00:20:48.680
Ahhh. Good stuff.

00:22:15.350 --> 00:22:17.730
Thank you very maid for coming!

00:22:19.730 --> 00:22:23.190
Red King crabs aren't real crabs.

00:22:25.780 --> 00:22:32.160
Humans pray to beings they cannot see
or whose existence they cannot prove.

00:22:32.160 --> 00:22:35.450
If one's prayers are answered, they believe
in the existence of their guiding force.

00:22:35.450 --> 00:22:38.920
If not, they doubt whether
their prayers were sufficient.

00:22:40.750 --> 00:22:44.170
Either way, they still choose to believe.

00:22:47.170 --> 00:22:51.840
Please, let Arashiyama and I
become closer this summer.

00:22:51.840 --> 00:22:56.990
I don't mean "closer" in
an impure way, though.

00:22:56.990 --> 00:23:00.070
But if I had to say one way or the other,

00:23:00.070 --> 00:23:04.340
I wouldn't be against the idea,
I just wanna take it slow.

00:23:04.340 --> 00:23:06.820
Something like that.

00:23:06.820 --> 00:23:10.630
No wait, I don't mean like a
"just friends" type of thing-

00:23:10.630 --> 00:23:12.260
Of course I'm totally serious-

00:23:12.260 --> 00:23:16.490
I mean, I honestly value her feelings too-

00:23:16.490 --> 00:23:20.710
If I just meant that in a naughty
way, that'd make me a creep-

00:23:20.710 --> 00:23:24.370
Wait, that's not the
point I'm trying to make.

00:23:24.370 --> 00:23:26.460
Uhh, I kinda lost my train of thought,

00:23:26.460 --> 00:23:29.170
but since you're a god,
I'm sure you understand.

00:23:29.170 --> 00:23:30.900
Anyway, I beg of you!

00:23:38.490 --> 00:23:41.100
The gods sure have it rough.

00:23:41.850 --> 00:23:46.020
The novel I read yesterday had
such a sad ending, it made me cry!

00:23:46.900 --> 00:23:48.820
Has that ever happened to you?

00:23:48.820 --> 00:23:50.110
Don't think so.

00:23:50.110 --> 00:23:51.780
What about crying during soap operas?

00:23:52.450 --> 00:23:53.280
What about movies?

00:23:53.280 --> 00:23:54.370
Good question.

00:23:54.370 --> 00:23:55.450
The stoic type, hmm?

00:23:55.450 --> 00:23:56.330
I guess.

00:23:56.330 --> 00:24:01.290
Even the "stoic" Senpai cries for
her mommy sometimes, doesn't she?

00:24:01.290 --> 00:24:02.920
Hey! What are you talking about!?

00:24:02.920 --> 00:24:04.380
It's a secret.

00:24:04.790 --> 00:24:06.540
Next time: 11th Street.

00:24:06.540 --> 00:24:08.380
"Kon-senpai's Summer of Tears".

00:24:08.380 --> 00:24:11.130
Round 'n round, all together now.
